    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33612" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Pandātārĭa</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-ērĭa</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-ōrĭa</span></b> ),
